---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "纠错反馈与编辑部联系通道";
const pageDesc = "读者勘误、数据失效反馈通道与响应承诺。";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${pageTitle} - 机场wiki指南`}
  description={pageDesc}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "首页", url: "/" },
    { name: pageTitle, url: Astro.url.pathname }
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">{pageTitle}</h1>
    <p class="text-base text-slate-500 mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100">{pageDesc}</p>
    <div class="article-content max-w-none">
      <p>若您在浏览本站过程中发现任何失效链接、套餐资费变动、测试数据差异或错别字，欢迎向我们反馈：</p>
      <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 my-5 text-sm">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">官方反馈邮箱：</span>
            <code class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded text-slate-800 font-mono text-sm select-all">mingxiaoxin1314 [at] gmail.com</code>
          </div>
          <button type="button" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('mingxiaoxin1314' + '@' + 'gmail.com').then(()=>{const b=this;const o=b.innerText;b.innerText='已复制！';b.classList.add('bg-emerald-600','text-white');setTimeout(()=>{b.innerText=o;b.classList.remove('bg-emerald-600','text-white')},2000)})" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-blue-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
            <span>一键复制完整邮箱</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2.5">请附带相关页面 URL 及您的实测截图或日志，我们将在3个工作日内复核并公示变更记录。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
